    {
      "id": "fight",
      "type": "story",
      "position": {
        "x": 1400,
        "y": 540
      },
      "data": {
        "kind": "exit",
        "title": "Roll for initiative",
        "description": "A fight breaks out in the Heron between the player (and Kell, if she's with them) and Master Sallow with his sword-cane and the Crakes, in the grain dust and the swinging lantern light. Until fights are built, the story's stand-in fights it out (the Crakes go down and Sallow surrenders, very politely), and the scene picks up after it: held and surrendered, he's Kell's to arrest.",
        "closing": "Close on the moment the fight breaks out: Sallow's cane slides apart into a thin bright sword and the Crakes roll their shoulders; the dust in the lantern light, the lanterns swinging dangerously close to it, and anyone with any sense stepping smartly out of the way. End with 'Roll for initiative!'",
        "result": "mixed",
        "exitKind": "combat",
        "next": "kings-morning",
